{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292050","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029205001:1":{"text":"방금 그 사람이 도망친 보물 도둑들과 “큰 건수”를 벌인다고 했어요.","source_cn":"刚才那个人已经交代了，逃跑的盗宝贼们在搞一笔“大生意”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x840751B154EF7CC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029205002:0":{"text":"혹시 뭔가 아는 거 있어요?","source_cn":"你对此知道些什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15E22B8DAF44667B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029205003:0":{"text":"아, 정말이에요? 난 아무것도 몰라요!","source_cn":"啊，真的吗？我什么都不知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC66FA37C9F1D512","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1029205003":{"text":"아, 정말이에요? 난 아무것도 몰라요!","source_cn":"啊，真的吗？我什么都不知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC66FA37C9F1D512","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029205004:0":{"text":"아니요! 말할게요, 말한다고요...","source_cn":"别别别！我说我说，我说还不行吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A95A9BD842DE95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7: